OL,3,AFlight price rises due to 'foolish
OL,4,Aleaders' starting wars, Virgin's
OL,5,ABranson says
OL,6,
OL,7,FVirgin Group founder Sir Richard
OL,8,FBranson has blamed flight price rises
OL,9,Fon "foolish leaders" starting wars, in
OL,10,Fa thinly veiled reference to the
OL,11,FUS-Israel conflict with Iran.
OL,13,FMiddle East tensions have choked the
OL,14,Fproduction and transportation of
OL,15,Fmillions of barrels of oil, causing a
OL,16,Fsurge in the price of car and jet
OL,17,Ffuels, which are made from oil.
OL,19,FIn May, Virgin Atlantic added a fuel
OL,20,Fsurcharge to ticket prices in response.
